  <ScenTitle>Probe or Feint, 1963</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;As Red China edges closer to a nuclear weapon, many figures, including the president of the United States, watch with increasing edge. Eventually retaliatory action is decided upon-but in a way that will not be initially obvious...&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
